From 4b17869efe1a2587941e1e89ab19e90f0d46a241 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:06:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] aop_audio: add the J713 (MacBook Air 13", M4) mics

Three-mic array like the J613 (ADT audio-hp-mic: imi1..imi3, 48 kHz).
Untested: the T8132 AOP driver path isn't verified on hardware yet.
---
 .../MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf        | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf

diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6391ad5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf	
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Syntax 7
+
+SectionUseCase."HiFi" {
+	Comment "Default"
+	File "/conf.d/aop_audio/3chan/HiFi.conf"
+}
